{"id": "core-res-multistep", "name": "RES Multistep", "family": "sampler", "subfamily": "multistep ODE, exponential", "plain": "Second-order exponential multistep on x0, one call per step; the first step and last step are Euler. Calls the shared res_multistep function with \u03b7=0. Deterministic.", "math": "Symbols: x current latent; \u03c3=sigmas[i]; \u03c3'=sigmas[i+1]; D=denoised (x0 prediction after CFG); U=uncond_denoised; d=(x\u2212D)/\u03c3. \nt=\u2212log \u03c3, \u03c6\u2081(z)=(e^z\u22121)/z, \u03c6\u2082(z)=(\u03c6\u2081(z)\u22121)/z. t_d=\u2212log \u03c3_down, h=t_d\u2212t, c\u2082=(t_{i\u22121}\u2212t_old)/h where t_old=\u2212log(previous \u03c3_down). b\u2081=\u03c6\u2081(\u2212h)\u2212\u03c6\u2082(\u2212h)/c\u2082, b\u2082=\u03c6\u2082(\u2212h)/c\u2082 (NaN\u21920).\n\u03c3_down=\u03c3'. First step or \u03c3'=0: x'=x+d(\u03c3'\u2212\u03c3). Otherwise x'=e^{\u2212h}x+h(b\u2081D+b\u2082D_old).", "props": {"order": 2, "stages": "1", "stochastic": "deterministic", "multistep": true, "prediction_space": "x0 in \u2212log \u03c3", "final_sigma0": "Explicit: \u03c3_down=0 takes the Euler branch, equals D.", "flow_const": "No CONST branch; \u2212log \u03c3 on all models."}, "evidence": [{"where": "ComfyUI/comfy/k_diffusion/sampling.py:1527", "symbol": "sample_res_multistep"}, {"where": "ComfyUI/comfy/k_diffusion/sampling.py:1462", "symbol": "res_multistep"}, {"where": "ComfyUI/comfy/k_diffusion/sampling.py:1490", "symbol": "sigma_down == 0"}, {"where": "ComfyUI/comfy/k_diffusion/sampling.py:1501", "symbol": "t_old"}, {"where": "ComfyUI/comfy/k_diffusion/sampling.py:1506", "symbol": "b1"}, {"where": "ComfyUI/comfy/k_diffusion/sampling.py:1513", "symbol": "sigma_fn"}, {"where": "ComfyUI/comfy/samplers.py:974", "symbol": "res_multistep"}], "providers": [{"pack": "core", "author": "Comfy Org and contributors", "licence": "GPL-3.0", "kind": "original", "nodes": ["KSampler", "KSamplerAdvanced", "KSamplerSelect"], "note": "", "verdict": "", "risks": [], "res4lyf": fa